    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d310-a3">

                <pb facs="0486" n="392" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg392"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3 in No. 9.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Coxe to Mr. Mendoza.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-10-15"><hi rendition="#italic">October 15,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I have the honor to inform your excellency that my powers do not authorize me,
                    without special instructions from my Government, to enter upon official
                    relations with the authorities of a power near which I am not accredited, and
                    that for that reason, much to my regret, I shall be obliged to abstain for the
                    present from treating of diplomatic affairs with the officers of the Greater
                    Republic of Central America.</p>
                <p>With great consideration,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Macgrane Coxe.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
